("v1739", "type", "String")
("v1739", "scalar", "← All assurance topics ASSURANCE / INDEPENDENT TOPIC Who can take part? The second worked example: selected markup evidence, human evaluation and accessible journeys in use. The current assessment covers five homepage entry routes. Levels describe evidence maturity within that scope; every topic keeps its own requirements and open work. Accessibility Level 2 — Mechanically checked Selected homepage markup checks across five entry routes. Human keyboard, assistive-technology, reflow and visual evaluation remain open. Scope of accessibility evaluation · supported · level 1 — Authored scope and explicit boundaries. Document language markers · supported · level 2 — Current generated entry markup; presence checks only. Skip-link target · supported · level 2 — Current generated entry markup; presence checks only. Image alternative attributes · supported · level 2 — Current generated entry markup; presence checks only.")
