("v2168", "type", "String")
("v2168", "scalar", "ATTENTION\n\nAm I listening, or already preparing my answer?\n\nI want to make room for what my children are actually telling me, including feelings I cannot immediately fix. Sometimes the next good thing is to put the task down and stay.\n\nExplore listening →")
("v2166", "item", "v2168")
("v2169", "type", "String")
("v2169", "scalar", "AUTHORITY\n\nCan I set a boundary without making love feel conditional?\n\nBeing responsible includes saying no when something is unsafe. I want the reason to be understandable, and the relationship to remain a place of care even when we disagree.\n\nExplore restraint →")
("v2166", "item", "v2169")
("v2170", "type", "String")
("v2170", "scalar", "REPAIR\n\nCan I say I was wrong without making them comfort me?\n\nAn apology should name what I did and be followed by a change. My children should not have to carry the work of protecting my image of myself.\n\nExplore repair →")
("v2166", "item", "v2170")
("v2171", "type", "String")
("v2171", "scalar", "GROWING ROOM\n\nAm I helping them become themselves?\n\nI can offer support, experience and protection while leaving room for their own interests and judgment. The question is what helps them grow, rather than what makes my plans easier.\n\nExplore care →")
("v2166", "item", "v2171")
