("v2231", "key", "text")
("v2232", "type", "String")
("v2232", "scalar", "QUESTIONS / CHRISTIAN How do I actually\nlive like Jesus? Here. With these people. With the power I have. I’m building software, pursuing an account of the physical world, and trying to follow Christ. I want those commitments to answer to one another—in the way I work, listen and care. The question becomes real in what I do next. AN OPEN HAND. A REAL RESPONSIBILITY. Faith has to meet the person in front of me. I want following Christ to become visible in how I pay attention, share power and remain answerable. Sometimes that means helping. Sometimes it means a boundary that protects someone else. 01 / ATTEND See the person. Listen before I turn someone’s situation into my explanation. Separate what I know from what I am assuming. 02 / MAKE ROOM")
("v2231", "value", "v2232")
