("v2347", "scalar", "ASSURANCE / TOPICS What can we stand behind? Assurance is a collection of questions about a product. Each topic declares its scope, shows its evidence and keeps its unfinished work visible. 20\ncatalogue front doors assessed 6\nindependent assurance topics Evidence before confidence\n· open gaps stay visible ✺ Reading contrast Inspect component contrast and the repaired dark-on-dark regression. This topic has its own evidence gates, scope and roadmap. ✺ Reading experience")
