("v2830", "key", "text")
("v2831", "type", "String")
("v2831", "scalar", "AARON ALDERMAN / AN ATLAS OF IDEAS The world keeps opening. Forty places. Three territories. More than one way through. Start with a question, follow a connection, and return with a different view. Every light is a place. Hover or use Tab to discover it, then click or press Enter to explore. Swipe or scroll sideways to discover more, or use the full list below. Choose a light on the map. Tap for a preview, then choose Explore to open the place. Your journey is beginning. Seen places are remembered only in this browser. Without JavaScript, each light opens its place directly; visits aren’t remembered. An imagined geography for real questions. The landscape is an illustration; the routes organise themes, not physical locations or scientific equivalences. TERRITORY 01 / 16 PLACES")
