("v2908", "entry", "v2913")
("v2913", "type", "Entry")
("v2913", "key", "text")
("v2914", "type", "String")
("v2914", "scalar", "CLAIMIPEDIA / A SHARED WORLD OF INQUIRY An interactive introduction Knowledge, connected.\nUnderstanding, evolving. Claimipedia is a framework for versioned claims, evidence and explicit review methods. It keeps the question, its scope, its sources and the method of judgment connected—so people can inspect a conclusion, understand a disagreement and revisit it. The world How we know What we do THE SOFTWARE AND THE PHILOSOPHY Keep the connections.\nKeep the distinctions. 01 / NOTICE Start with something real. Give each claim a stable identity, a version and a stated scope. Keep evidence attached to the claim without treating its inclusion as proof that the claim is true.")
("v2913", "value", "v2914")
