("v2995", "key", "text")
("v2996", "type", "String")
("v2996", "scalar", "A CONNECTED SET OF CAPABILITIES Creativity What else could this become? Creativity is a set of ways to explore possibilities: notice a pattern, try a different arrangement, follow a surprising connection, and see what survives the change. Begin with a small pattern you can grow and count, then follow the larger questions of intention, authorship and composing a world someone else can explore.")
("v2995", "value", "v2996")
