("v3055", "type", "String")
("v3055", "scalar", "ENCOUNTER / MEANING IN REACH See what you’re\nchanging. Meet an idea where it appears. Follow it to its meaning. Make a change with a route back. A working example. Real contracts. Room to look underneath. One thing. More than one way to meet it. Meet it. A title, a menu, a row. Start with the thing in front of you. Look underneath. Find the source, the rules and the choices that give it meaning. Follow the change. An explicit edit route says what can change, and where the change belongs. A SMALL ENCOUNTER / THE EXISTING STORY EXAMPLE")
("v3054", "value", "v3055")
