("v3359", "scalar", "INSPECT / SOURCE-BOUND Creator Studio Shape an idea as a story, a film or an interactive experience. These connections are extracted from recorded source declarations. Exact identity establishes declared reuse; it does not establish deployment or equivalent behaviour. Shared capabilities & dependencies No shared capability identity is declared in the selected sources. The source bindings below remain inspectable. Source bindings Creative Studio workspace test source, retained exactly. Creator Studio is the requested public display name. This describes intended forms and boundaries; it is not a test-run receipt or evidence of public deployment. No shared-capability edges are inferred. Readable source SOURCE Exact source, with shared syntax highlighting. Line wrapping is visual; the snapshot and its SHA-256 remain unchanged. Source highlighting uses the shared Encounter presenter.")
