("v5239", "type", "String")
("v5239", "scalar", "AGENT HARNESS Mission Control Sourcery’s agent harness and automatic workflow mechanism. This microsite introduces the work and its selected source bindings. Source inspection records declarations, rather than claiming a deployed application runtime. A harness for agents and automatic workflows Mission Control belongs to Sourcery. It coordinates agent work through the internal job system: tasks, workers, progress, results and review. Claimipedia Science is one application of that mechanism.      ")
