("v5610", "type", "String")
("v5610", "scalar", "UNDERSTANDING PEOPLE Beautiful words. The wrong answer. An answer can sound convincing while missing what someone meant. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. A proposal developed from one recorded mistake In the recorded exchange, an explanation brought ideas from an earlier discussion into a different question. The words fitted together, but the explanation had lost touch with the person speaking. The interpretation was withdrawn. The next inquiry began with the particular mistake: what had been misunderstood, and what would a more relevant answer do differently?     ")
