("v5846", "type", "String")
("v5846", "scalar", "USING POWER RESPONSIBLY Room for faith. Room for a question. This path explores a religious interpretation with its starting beliefs made clear. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. An optional religious interpretation The source begins by assuming God exists. It then asks how a good God might make room for a world in which people have real choices. That reading does not explain away every case of suffering or absence. You can stay with the question, follow the Christian account of hope, or return to the scientific paths. They do not require this belief.     ")
