("v6034", "type", "String")
("v6034", "scalar", "FINDING THINGS OUT How could we tell the explanations apart? Choose a measurement that could tell competing explanations apart. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. A plan for physical tests Two explanations may agree on one reading and disagree on another. A timing reference, a reversed path or a different waiting time can help reveal the difference. Choose a check at the bench. These are proposed ways to test ideas, not measurements being collected here. Better tools can be useful even when the result agrees with existing physics. Choose a comparison to see which difference it could reveal.    ")
