("v6214", "scalar", "LOOK MORE CLOSELY\nWhat record could tell the structures apart?\n\nKeep enough of the method for someone else to check the result.\n\n↗")
("v6210", "item", "v6214")
("v6215", "type", "String")
("v6215", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nReturn to what the detector discards\n\nTwo different things can look the same through one kind of measurement.\n\n↗")
("v6210", "item", "v6215")
("v6216", "type", "String")
("v6216", "scalar", "FOLLOW THE RESEARCH\nExplore the smaller experiment\n\nA measuring tool can miss a change that another tool would reveal.\n\n↗")
("v6210", "item", "v6216")
("v6217", "type", "String")
("v6217", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nHow could many people explore this together?\n\nLet machines help with the work while people keep a meaningful say in what is made.\n\n↗")
