("v6326", "scalar", "UNDERSTANDING PEOPLE I trusted the process. A passage from Aaron’s own account. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. Aaron’s account, in wording open to revision PERSONAL ACCOUNT · WORKING DRAFT I experienced my children becoming alienated from me. It broke my heart. My marriage suffered, and my wife left. I took kenosis seriously. I trusted the process. Along the way, I had to remember to care. In the intensity of everything, it could become totalizing.    ")
