("v6706", "type", "String")
("v6706", "scalar", "USING POWER RESPONSIBLY Let the correction leave a seam. When an explanation changes, leave a way to understand why. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. An earlier interpretation that was withdrawn The collection keeps an earlier interpretation alongside the correction that withdrew it. That lets a reader see what went wrong and where the next inquiry began. Open the correction. Keeping the change visible does not guarantee that every later claim is right. It gives someone else a better chance to question and check it. Open the correction to see why the earlier explanation was withdrawn.    ")
