("v6800", "key", "text")
("v6801", "type", "String")
("v6801", "scalar", "USING POWER RESPONSIBLY More help from machines. More say for people. Let machines help with the work while people keep a meaningful say in what is made. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. A design philosophy with a small working example AI can help write software, suggest changes and run checks. People still decide what is worth making, who it serves and whether it is good. The aim is to make a system’s workings understandable and changeable. You should be able to follow an idea back to its source and ask what was checked. The workshop lets you try this with two small edits.     ")
("v6800", "value", "v6801")
