("v6897", "type", "String")
("v6897", "scalar", "USING POWER RESPONSIBLY A reading is not yet a prediction. A reading that fits a text is not yet evidence that it predicted an event. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. A proposed way to test interpretations of texts Start with the passage, when it was written and what it claims. Then ask what separate evidence there is for the event it describes. The research keeps these questions apart. It also asks whether an interpretation works on cases that were not used to invent it. This room makes no forecast and gives no personal prophecy. Open each kind of evidence. Notice why one does not automatically establish the next.    ")
("v6896", "value", "v6897")
