("v7090", "key", "text")
("v7091", "type", "String")
("v7091", "scalar", "UNDERSTANDING PEOPLE An intention is not yet an action. Choosing to act and carrying out an action are different parts of a story. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. A proposal for describing connections carefully Open the links between getting ready, choosing, acting and receiving feedback. Each link raises a question about what connects the steps. A neat diagram can hide a gap in our understanding. The research marks uncertain or missing connections instead of treating every arrow as an established explanation of the brain. Open each link to see what would be needed to explain it.    ")
("v7090", "value", "v7091")
