("v7123", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nReturn to the canopy\n\nLooking closely at one thing can make its surroundings harder to notice.\n\n↗")
("v7119", "item", "v7123")
("v7124", "type", "String")
("v7124", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nLet intentions meet constraints\n\nWaiting has different costs when needs are more urgent.\n\n↗")
