("v7612", "key", "text")
("v7613", "type", "String")
("v7613", "scalar", "SPECULATION 5 · A PAPER THEATRE The Moving Picture Book The same fable, played out on a toy stage. Every cut-out, curtain and splash is drawn in code, composited frame by frame, and signed with a receipt, like the spells in the story. Rendered from code by this site’s own pipeline, every frame reproducible. No stock footage, no external assets, no AI video generators. Sound starts off. There’s a small music box and a few page-turns if you’d like them: use the film’s volume control. What happens, in words 0:00\nThe Sorcerer’s Apprentice: a moving picture book, a fable for the age of AI, retold by Sourcery. 0:04\nChapter I: The Apprentice 0:07\nBroom, fetch the water. Don’t trouble me with the details. 0:10\nChapter II: The Flood 0:15\nNobody lied. Nobody decided anything, either. 0:16\nBrooms: 40. Buckets: 80. Decisions anyone made: 0.")
("v7612", "value", "v7613")
