("v7948", "item", "v7951")
("v7952", "type", "String")
("v7952", "scalar", "It calculates consequences of declared assumptions; it does not establish how actual households behave or adjudicate the tweet’s empirical predictions.")
("v7948", "item", "v7952")
("v7953", "type", "String")
("v7953", "scalar", "Values, reported satisfaction, material feasibility and the practical ability to renegotiate are distinct.")
("v7948", "item", "v7953")
("v7954", "type", "String")
("v7954", "scalar", "No calculated willingness value stands in for consent, happiness or trust.")
("v7948", "item", "v7954")
("v7955", "type", "String")
("v7955", "scalar", "Standing is unchanged by work, refusal, withdrawal or leaving.")
("v7948", "item", "v7955")
("v7956", "type", "String")
("v7956", "scalar", "Four orientations; four sets of tradeoffs.")
("v7948", "item", "v7956")
("v7957", "type", "String")
("v7957", "scalar", "Role-based specialization A primarily provides income; B primarily manages the home.")
("v7948", "item", "v7957")
("v7958", "type", "String")
("v7958", "scalar", "They value continuity, distinct responsibilities and an inherited account of family life.")
("v7948", "item", "v7958")
("v7959", "type", "String")
("v7959", "scalar", "Both welcome their roles, the work is feasible, and each contribution is recognized.")
("v7948", "item", "v7959")
("v7960", "type", "String")
("v7960", "scalar", "Exceptions can be understood as care within a continuing commitment.")
("v7948", "item", "v7960")
("v7961", "type", "String")
("v7961", "scalar", "The partners attach different meanings to the same roles, or an assigned responsibility exceeds the person's capacity while the label conceals that mismatch.")
("v7948", "item", "v7961")
("v7947", "value", "v7948")
