("v7985", "type", "String")
("v7985", "scalar", "HUMAN INTERACTION OVER TIME The Field The Field is a framework for modelling how human interactions unfold over time. It makes resources, permissions, obligations, dependencies and attributed expectations explicit. Compare choices to see how they change relationships and what people can do next. A FICTIONAL SITUATION. A REAL KIND OF RESPONSIBILITY. The shift is still uncovered. Mira asks privately for help covering an evening workshop shift. The freezer needs maintenance. The coordinator says there is no budget for cover. You have limits of your own. What is known The shift is uncovered, maintenance is overdue, and Mira has asked privately for help. What is reported The coordinator says there is no budget. That is a report, rather than the whole explanation. What is still unknown")
("v7984", "value", "v7985")
