("v8211", "type", "String")
("v8211", "scalar", "AARON ALDERMAN / AUTHOR A perspective on shared terrain. Begin with listening, enter a possibility, and return to what a story asks of its reader. These highlights frame a literary journey through shared questions. AARON ALDERMAN / AN ATLAS OF IDEAS A map of attention and imagined worlds. Begin with listening, enter a possibility, and return to what a story asks of its reader. These highlights frame a literary journey through shared questions. Every light is a place. Hover or use Tab to discover it, then click or press Enter to explore. Swipe or scroll sideways to discover more, or use the full list below. Choose a light on the map. Tap for a preview, then choose Explore to open the place. Your journey is beginning. Seen places are remembered only in this browser.")
