("v8291", "scalar", "AARON ALDERMAN / A PERSONAL EXPEDITION Inside the mind of a\nmodern-day\nauthor.\nANOTHER SIDE Words, worlds, and the possibilities between the lines. BEGIN WITH Questions What do I owe the people who enter my stories? Threads Follow attention, story and revision. Atlas / Map Explore attention, possibility and story. THE WORK THROUGH AN AUTHOR’S EYES Words make worlds. Worlds teach us what to notice.")
