("v8943", "item", "v8951")
("v8952", "type", "String")
("v8952", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nSee an explanation actually withdrawn\n\nAn answer can sound convincing while missing what someone meant.\n\n↗")
("v8943", "item", "v8952")
("v8953", "type", "String")
("v8953", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nKeep a way to change your mind\n\nWhen an explanation changes, leave a way to understand why.\n\n↗")
("v8943", "item", "v8953")
("v8954", "type", "String")
("v8954", "scalar", "REFLECTIVE PASSAGE\nVisit the uncooperative horse\n\nThe guide offers a lesson. The horse has noticed something else.\n\n↗")
("v8943", "item", "v8954")
