("v9006", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nReturn to a surviving influence\n\nHiding part of a system does not necessarily stop it affecting the rest.\n\n↗")
("v8997", "item", "v9006")
("v9007", "type", "String")
("v9007", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nAsk the detector another question\n\nTwo different things can look the same through one kind of measurement.\n\n↗")
("v8997", "item", "v9007")
("v9008", "type", "String")
("v9008", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nKeep the limit on the map\n\nA failed attempt is useful when we can explain exactly what it rules out.\n\n↗")
