("v9059", "scalar", "OPTIONAL CONTINUATION\nContinue into the Christian reading\n\nHope for restoration does not require calling suffering good.\n\n↗")
("v9050", "item", "v9059")
("v9060", "type", "String")
("v9060", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nVisit the reading room\n\nA reading that fits a text is not yet evidence that it predicted an event.\n\n↗")
("v9050", "item", "v9060")
("v9061", "type", "String")
("v9061", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nReturn to the observatory\n\nA big question becomes more useful when we can name what is still missing.\n\n↗")
