("v9083", "scalar", "In the source’s Christian reading, God enters human life and shares its cost. Resurrection names a hope that brokenness will not have the final word.")
("v9074", "item", "v9083")
("v9084", "type", "String")
("v9084", "scalar", "This is a statement of faith, not a result from physics. It does not ask you to say that your own losses were necessary or deserved. It offers a question about how hope might shape care, patience and honesty.")
