("v9111", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nReturn to the unresolved question\n\nThis path explores a religious interpretation with its starting beliefs made clear.\n\n↗")
("v9102", "item", "v9111")
("v9112", "type", "String")
("v9112", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nBring hope back to attention\n\nWho or what needs my attention here?\n\n↗")
("v9102", "item", "v9112")
("v9113", "type", "String")
("v9113", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nLeave useful work for another\n\nAn outside reply can reveal a question we failed to ask ourselves.\n\n↗")
