("v9166", "scalar", "LOOK MORE CLOSELY\nWho calibrated the richer view?\n\nBefore trusting a number, check what the tool can measure.\n\n↗")
("v9157", "item", "v9166")
("v9167", "type", "String")
("v9167", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nReturn to the fork\n\nYou can come back to the same place with something facing a different way.\n\n↗")
("v9157", "item", "v9167")
("v9168", "type", "String")
("v9168", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nHow do you preserve what a model knows?\n\nLet machines help with the work while people keep a meaningful say in what is made.\n\n↗")
("v9157", "item", "v9168")
("v9169", "type", "String")
("v9169", "scalar", "FOLLOW THE RESEARCH\nTry a different detector problem\n\nA matching number is a clue. It does not identify the thing you found.\n\n↗")
