("v9275", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nAsk what the control costs\n\nImproving one part of a result can make another part worse.\n\n↗")
("v9266", "item", "v9275")
("v9276", "type", "String")
("v9276", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nWalk toward the observatories\n\nA big question becomes more useful when we can name what is still missing.\n\n↗")
("v9266", "item", "v9276")
("v9277", "type", "String")
