("v9329", "scalar", "READ A RELATED ACCOUNT\nRead the original mismatch\n\nAn answer can sound convincing while missing what someone meant.\n\n↗")
("v9320", "item", "v9329")
("v9330", "type", "String")
("v9330", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nHear from the horse\n\nThe guide offers a lesson. The horse has noticed something else.\n\n↗")
("v9320", "item", "v9330")
("v9331", "type", "String")
("v9331", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nLeave room for an answer\n\nHolding back can give someone room. It can also leave someone exposed.\n\n↗")
