("v9387", "type", "String")
("v9387", "scalar", "MATHEMATICAL LIMIT\nWhat if no echo survives?\n\nOnce a record leaves out a difference, that record may be unable to recover it.\n\n↗")
("v9378", "item", "v9387")
("v9388", "type", "String")
("v9388", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nFollow a trace through time\n\nThe evidence left today is only part of what happened.\n\n↗")
("v9378", "item", "v9388")
("v9389", "type", "String")
