("v9498", "scalar", "FOLLOW THE RESEARCH\nCan something return changed?\n\nYou can come back to the same place with something facing a different way.\n\n↗")
("v9489", "item", "v9498")
("v9499", "type", "String")
("v9499", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nDoes this happen between people?\n\nAn answer can sound convincing while missing what someone meant.\n\n↗")
("v9489", "item", "v9499")
("v9500", "type", "String")
("v9500", "scalar", "FOLLOW THE RESEARCH\nWhat would reveal the Monster?\n\nA matching number is a clue. It does not identify the thing you found.\n\n↗")
("v9489", "item", "v9500")
("v9501", "type", "String")
("v9501", "scalar", "A PATH INTO THE WIDER WORLD\nBefore a reading, what can coexist?\n\nSome choices work together. Other combinations break a stated rule.\n\n↗")
