("v9696", "item", "v9699")
("v9700", "type", "String")
("v9700", "scalar", "The evidence left today is only part of what happened.")
("v9696", "item", "v9700")
("v9701", "type", "String")
("v9701", "scalar", "The interactive example has its own motion control.")
("v9696", "item", "v9701")
("v9702", "type", "String")
("v9702", "scalar", "Scroll inside it if you need more room.")
("v9696", "item", "v9702")
("v9703", "type", "String")
("v9703", "scalar", "A proposed approach to material and historical evidence A mark may be absent because a process never happened, because the mark was damaged later, or because the measuring tool missed it.")
("v9696", "item", "v9703")
("v9704", "type", "String")
("v9704", "scalar", "Choose an explanation to see what it would need.")
("v9696", "item", "v9704")
("v9705", "type", "String")
("v9705", "scalar", "Weathering, burial and later care can all change which traces survive.")
("v9696", "item", "v9705")
("v9706", "type", "String")
("v9706", "scalar", "A claim about the past needs to account for those changes too.")
("v9696", "item", "v9706")
("v9707", "type", "String")
("v9707", "scalar", "Choose a reason a trace might be missing.")
("v9696", "item", "v9707")
("v9708", "type", "String")
("v9708", "scalar", "Read what would need checking.")
("v9696", "item", "v9708")
("v9709", "type", "String")
("v9709", "scalar", "")
