("v9828", "scalar", "FOLLOW THE RESEARCH\nAsk a rival to disagree\n\nA matching number is a clue. It does not identify the thing you found.\n\n↗")
("v9819", "item", "v9828")
("v9829", "type", "String")
("v9829", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nKeep the conditions attached\n\nA useful map leaves things out. We should be able to find out what.\n\n↗")
("v9819", "item", "v9829")
("v9830", "type", "String")
("v9830", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nCheck what the measuring tools can see\n\nBefore trusting a number, check what the tool can measure.\n\n↗")
