("v9883", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nLeave the correction visible\n\nWhen an explanation changes, leave a way to understand why.\n\n↗")
("v9874", "item", "v9883")
("v9884", "type", "String")
("v9884", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nAsk for the actual record\n\nKeep enough of the method for someone else to check the result.\n\n↗")
("v9874", "item", "v9884")
("v9885", "type", "String")
("v9885", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nReturn to systems people can direct\n\nLet machines help with the work while people keep a meaningful say in what is made.\n\n↗")
("v9874", "item", "v9885")
("v9886", "type", "String")
("v9886", "scalar", "A PATH INTO THE WIDER WORLD\nLet an ordinary object open the map\n\nA stone can tell several stories, and each needs a different kind of evidence.\n\n↗")
