("v10377", "scalar", "REFLECTIVE PASSAGE\nPut down the presentation\n\nBefore answering, ask what the other person is trying to do.\n\n↗")
("v10368", "item", "v10377")
("v10378", "type", "String")
("v10378", "scalar", "REFLECTIVE PASSAGE\nLook at the inconvenient reflection\n\nFeeling hurt does not tell us, by itself, which explanation is true.\n\n↗")
("v10368", "item", "v10378")
("v10379", "type", "String")
("v10379", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nSit by the water a while\n\nWho or what needs my attention here?\n\n↗")
