("v10654", "key", "text")
("v10655", "type", "String")
("v10655", "scalar", "AARON ALDERMAN / CHRISTIAN A perspective on shared terrain. Begin with hope, attend to a neighbour, and question what power is serving. The readings retain their own sources and limits; this lens does not turn an analogy into evidence. AARON ALDERMAN / AN ATLAS OF IDEAS A map for faith lived among people. Begin with hope, attend to a neighbour, and question what power is serving. The readings retain their own sources and limits; this lens does not turn an analogy into evidence. Every light is a place. Hover or use Tab to discover it, then click or press Enter to explore. Swipe or scroll sideways to discover more, or use the full list below. Choose a light on the map. Tap for a preview, then choose Explore to open the place. Your journey is beginning. Seen places are remembered only in this browser.")
("v10654", "value", "v10655")
