("v10808", "type", "String")
("v10808", "scalar", "READING AS CHRISTIAN As a Christian, ask how love of God and neighbour meets this question, what power should relinquish, and what hope asks you to practise. The underlying reading and source evidence are shared. Open the shared version ↗ UNDERSTANDING PEOPLE The same clearing. A different field of attention. Looking closely at one thing can make its surroundings harder to notice. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. A research overview with uncertain connections marked Try the two views of the clearing. One keeps several details visible. The other brings the leaf forward while the rest recedes. This changes the drawing; it does not test your attention. The research separates noticing, choosing, awareness and action because explaining one does not automatically explain the others. Try the broad view and the close view. Notice what each brings forward. ")
