("v11420", "scalar", "Keep the first number as a second record and you can tell these pairs apart. That uses new information. It does not recover the answer from the sum alone.")
("v11410", "item", "v11420")
("v11421", "type", "String")
("v11421", "scalar", "Try both pairs. Then keep a second record and see what becomes clear.")
("v11410", "item", "v11421")
