("v11424", "item", "v11430")
("v11431", "type", "String")
("v11431", "scalar", "A mathematical limit on what a record can tell us The pairs 1 and 3, or 2 and 2, both add up to 4.")
("v11424", "item", "v11431")
("v11432", "type", "String")
("v11432", "scalar", "If the only record is the sum, you cannot tell which pair it came from.")
("v11424", "item", "v11432")
("v11433", "type", "String")
("v11433", "scalar", "Keep the first number as a second record and you can tell these pairs apart.")
("v11424", "item", "v11433")
("v11434", "type", "String")
