("v11567", "type", "String")
("v11567", "scalar", "READING AS CHRISTIAN As a Christian, ask how love of God and neighbour meets this question, what power should relinquish, and what hope asks you to practise. The underlying reading and source evidence are shared. Open the shared version ↗ FINDING THINGS OUT The change can be real. The detector can miss it. A measuring tool can miss a change that another tool would reveal. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. A result in a specified mathematical model In the research example, one measurement gives the same answer while part of the mathematical system changes. Measuring several related quantities together can reveal more. This works only if the measurements reach the changing part and are checked against a known reference. The research includes a computer experiment. A physical device would need its own tests. Switch between the views. The added reference shows where each signal is in its cycle. ")
("v11566", "value", "v11567")
