("v11663", "scalar", "LOOK MORE CLOSELY\nWhen does leaving room leave someone exposed?\n\nHolding back can give someone room. It can also leave someone exposed.\n\n↗")
("v11654", "item", "v11663")
("v11664", "type", "String")
("v11664", "scalar", "FOLLOW THE HUMAN QUESTION\nWho is carrying the cost?\n\nWho or what needs my attention here?\n\n↗")
("v11654", "item", "v11664")
("v11665", "type", "String")
("v11665", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nBuild systems people can understand and direct\n\nLet machines help with the work while people keep a meaningful say in what is made.\n\n↗")
("v11654", "item", "v11665")
("v11666", "type", "String")
("v11666", "scalar", "PERSONAL ACCOUNT\nWhy I took this question seriously\n\nA passage from Aaron’s own account.\n\n↗")
("v11654", "item", "v11666")
("v11667", "type", "String")
("v11667", "scalar", "A PATH INTO THE WIDER WORLD\nWho lives with the consequences?\n\nWaiting has different costs when needs are more urgent.\n\n↗")
