("v11678", "type", "String")
("v11678", "scalar", "READING AS CHRISTIAN As a Christian, ask how love of God and neighbour meets this question, what power should relinquish, and what hope asks you to practise. The underlying reading and source evidence are shared. Open the shared version ↗ FINDING THINGS OUT How could we tell the explanations apart? Choose a measurement that could tell competing explanations apart. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. A plan for physical tests Two explanations may agree on one reading and disagree on another. A timing reference, a reversed path or a different waiting time can help reveal the difference. Choose a check at the bench. These are proposed ways to test ideas, not measurements being collected here. Better tools can be useful even when the result agrees with existing physics. Choose a comparison to see which difference it could reveal. ")
("v11677", "value", "v11678")
