("v11843", "scalar", "READING AS CHRISTIAN As a Christian, ask how love of God and neighbour meets this question, what power should relinquish, and what hope asks you to practise. The underlying reading and source evidence are shared. Open the shared version ↗ FINDING THINGS OUT A matching number is only a clue. A matching number is a clue. It does not identify the thing you found. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. A mathematical comparison of three chosen structures The research compares three mathematical structures. One broad measurement makes them look alike. A more detailed count gives three different answers: 744, 24 and 0. Switch the view to see the counts. They separate these three chosen structures. They do not prove that a physical object contains the structure nicknamed the Monster. Compare the broad view with the detailed count. Which view tells the three structures apart? ")
