("v12012", "type", "String")
("v12012", "scalar", "READING AS CHRISTIAN As a Christian, ask how love of God and neighbour meets this question, what power should relinquish, and what hope asks you to practise. The underlying reading and source evidence are shared. Open the shared version ↗ UNDERSTANDING PEOPLE I trusted the process. A passage from Aaron’s own account. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. Aaron’s account, in wording open to revision PERSONAL ACCOUNT · WORKING DRAFT I experienced my children becoming alienated from me. It broke my heart. My marriage suffered, and my wife left. I took kenosis seriously. I trusted the process. Along the way, I had to remember to care. In the intensity of everything, it could become totalizing. ")
