("v12052", "type", "String")
("v12052", "scalar", "FOLLOW THE CONCEPT\nWhat did kenosis mean to me?\n\nBeing able to control something does not settle whether you should.\n\n↗")
("v12044", "item", "v12052")
("v12053", "type", "String")
("v12053", "scalar", "STAY WITH THE HUMAN QUESTION\nRemember to care\n\nWho or what needs my attention here?\n\n↗")
("v12044", "item", "v12053")
("v12054", "type", "String")
("v12054", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nReturn to the mathematical trail\n\nYou can come back to the same place with something facing a different way.\n\n↗")
