("v12284", "type", "String")
("v12284", "scalar", "READING AS CHRISTIAN As a Christian, ask how love of God and neighbour meets this question, what power should relinquish, and what hope asks you to practise. The underlying reading and source evidence are shared. Open the shared version ↗ USING POWER RESPONSIBLY Every map leaves something out. A useful map leaves things out. We should be able to find out what. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. A software research programme A map makes some parts of the world easier to see. It also leaves out detail. A model, diagram or summary does the same. Lift the layers of the map. Look for where the information came from, which assumptions it needs and what it cannot establish. A complete plan for an experiment does not prove that the experiment happened. Open each layer to see what the map needs you to know. ")
