("v12380", "scalar", "CONCEPTUAL CONNECTION\nDistinguish three different questions\n\n“Can I?”, “May I?” and “Should I?” are three different questions.\n\n↗")
("v12371", "item", "v12380")
("v12381", "type", "String")
("v12381", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nAsk who carries the cost\n\nWho or what needs my attention here?\n\n↗")
("v12371", "item", "v12381")
("v12382", "type", "String")
("v12382", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nRead the larger argument\n\nBeing able to control something does not settle whether you should.\n\n↗")
