("v12435", "scalar", "FOLLOW THE RESEARCH\nBuild a way to see it\n\nA measuring tool can miss a change that another tool would reveal.\n\n↗")
("v12426", "item", "v12435")
("v12436", "type", "String")
("v12436", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nWhat remains when relationships change?\n\nA passage from Aaron’s own account.\n\n↗")
("v12426", "item", "v12436")
("v12437", "type", "String")
("v12437", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nLook again at the measurement\n\nTwo different things can look the same through one kind of measurement.\n\n↗")
