("v12596", "type", "String")
("v12596", "scalar", "ENTER THE WORKSHOP\nTry a change and follow its consequences\n\nChange a title or label, then see exactly what follows.\n\n↗")
("v12588", "item", "v12596")
("v12597", "type", "String")
("v12597", "scalar", "LOOK MORE CLOSELY\nWhat should a map tell us about its limits?\n\nA useful map leaves things out. We should be able to find out what.\n\n↗")
("v12588", "item", "v12597")
("v12598", "type", "String")
("v12598", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nWhat does the model fail to hear?\n\nAn answer can sound convincing while missing what someone meant.\n\n↗")
("v12588", "item", "v12598")
("v12599", "type", "String")
("v12599", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nWhat should power leave alone?\n\nBeing able to control something does not settle whether you should.\n\n↗")
("v12588", "item", "v12599")
("v12600", "type", "String")
("v12600", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nKeep care in the loop\n\nWho or what needs my attention here?\n\n↗")
("v12588", "item", "v12600")
