("v12982", "type", "String")
("v12982", "scalar", "THE PRODUCT PHILOSOPHY\nWhat should the machine leave to us?\n\nLet machines help with the work while people keep a meaningful say in what is made.\n\n↗")
("v12973", "item", "v12982")
("v12983", "type", "String")
("v12983", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nWhat if a polished result misses the point?\n\nAn answer can sound convincing while missing what someone meant.\n\n↗")
("v12973", "item", "v12983")
("v12984", "type", "String")
("v12984", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nWho is this helping?\n\nWho or what needs my attention here?\n\n↗")
("v12973", "item", "v12984")
("v12985", "type", "String")
("v12985", "scalar", "A PATH INTO THE WIDER WORLD\nLeave something another person can continue\n\nAn outside reply can reveal a question we failed to ask ourselves.\n\n↗")
("v12973", "item", "v12985")
("v12986", "type", "String")
("v12986", "scalar", "Reading paths →")
("v12973", "item", "v12986")
("v12987", "type", "String")
