("v13057", "key", "text")
("v13058", "type", "String")
("v13058", "scalar", "THREADS / CHRISTIAN Faith, with open hands. AARON ALDERMAN / CHRISTIAN A faith I can live, and a reading I can question. How should I understand God, Jesus, the Bible and other religions? Begin with a personal Christian reading, then follow it into service, hope and ordinary life. BEGIN WITH THE BIG QUESTIONS How I read God, Jesus, the Bible and other religions. What am I trusting? How do I read faithfully without making my interpretation untouchable? A personal essay about a Christian centre, honest disagreement and a love that remains answerable. FOLLOW A THREAD INTO LIFE Three ways to keep reading. Move from interpretation into power, hope and the people close at hand. Each path has three short readings. 01 / POWER & SERVICE")
("v13057", "value", "v13058")
