("v13113", "type", "String")
("v13113", "scalar", "AARON ALDERMAN / DAD A perspective on shared terrain. Start with listening, make room for another person, and leave a route back after getting something wrong. Follow the small choices that shape a home. AARON ALDERMAN / AN ATLAS OF IDEAS A map for the everyday work of care. Start with listening, make room for another person, and leave a route back after getting something wrong. Follow the small choices that shape a home. Every light is a place. Hover or use Tab to discover it, then click or press Enter to explore. Swipe or scroll sideways to discover more, or use the full list below. Choose a light on the map. Tap for a preview, then choose Explore to open the place. Your journey is beginning. Seen places are remembered only in this browser.")
