("v13688", "scalar", "LOOK MORE CLOSELY\nWhat was the person trying to do?\n\nBefore answering, ask what the other person is trying to do.\n\n↗")
("v13679", "item", "v13688")
("v13689", "type", "String")
("v13689", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nWhat should a machine help us do?\n\nLet machines help with the work while people keep a meaningful say in what is made.\n\n↗")
("v13679", "item", "v13689")
("v13690", "type", "String")
("v13690", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nCome back to care\n\nWho or what needs my attention here?\n\n↗")
("v13679", "item", "v13690")
("v13691", "type", "String")
("v13691", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nWhat else does a representation leave out?\n\nTwo different things can look the same through one kind of measurement.\n\n↗")
