("v14369", "type", "String")
("v14369", "scalar", "Imagine two repeating signals that reach the same height. A measuring tool that keeps only their heights may report the same result, even if the signals rise and fall at different times.")
("v14360", "item", "v14369")
("v14370", "type", "String")
("v14370", "scalar", "Try the two views beside this story. The extra timing reference reveals a difference the first view left out. The drawing explains an idea; it is not a recording from an experiment.")
