("v14457", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nTake the question into a machine\n\nLet machines help with the work while people keep a meaningful say in what is made.\n\n↗")
("v14448", "item", "v14457")
("v14458", "type", "String")
("v14458", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nInspect what the proposal carries\n\nA useful map leaves things out. We should be able to find out what.\n\n↗")
("v14448", "item", "v14458")
("v14459", "type", "String")
("v14459", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nReturn to the open hand\n\nHolding back can give someone room. It can also leave someone exposed.\n\n↗")
