("v14470", "type", "String")
("v14470", "scalar", "READING AS DAD As Dad, ask what presence would look like here, whose room to grow matters, and what a patient act of repair might require. The underlying reading and source evidence are shared. Open the shared version ↗ UNDERSTANDING PEOPLE I trusted the process. A passage from Aaron’s own account. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. Aaron’s account, in wording open to revision PERSONAL ACCOUNT · WORKING DRAFT I experienced my children becoming alienated from me. It broke my heart. My marriage suffered, and my wife left. I took kenosis seriously. I trusted the process. Along the way, I had to remember to care. In the intensity of everything, it could become totalizing. ")
("v14469", "value", "v14470")
