("v14568", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nA path is another requirement\n\nA place can be allowed and still have no available route from here.\n\n↗")
("v14558", "item", "v14568")
("v14569", "type", "String")
("v14569", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nWho may choose?\n\n“Can I?”, “May I?” and “Should I?” are three different questions.\n\n↗")
("v14558", "item", "v14569")
("v14570", "type", "String")
("v14570", "scalar", "FOLLOW THE RESEARCH\nLet a pattern grow\n\nA precise counting rule can connect patterns without making them the same thing.\n\n↗")
