("v15002", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nReturn to the larger claim\n\nA big question becomes more useful when we can name what is still missing.\n\n↗")
("v14993", "item", "v15002")
("v15003", "type", "String")
("v15003", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nInspect the discarded distinction\n\nOnce a record leaves out a difference, that record may be unable to recover it.\n\n↗")
("v14993", "item", "v15003")
("v15004", "type", "String")
("v15004", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nChange another kind of view\n\nLooking closely at one thing can make its surroundings harder to notice.\n\n↗")
