("v15112", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nAsk why this trace survived\n\nThe evidence left today is only part of what happened.\n\n↗")
("v15103", "item", "v15112")
("v15113", "type", "String")
("v15113", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nWalk toward the patterned wall\n\nA precise counting rule can connect patterns without making them the same thing.\n\n↗")
("v15103", "item", "v15113")
("v15114", "type", "String")
("v15114", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nBring an instrument to the question\n\nChoose a measurement that could tell competing explanations apart.\n\n↗")
