("v15166", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nReturn to the optional horizon\n\nThis path explores a religious interpretation with its starting beliefs made clear.\n\n↗")
("v15157", "item", "v15166")
("v15167", "type", "String")
("v15167", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nThink about a surviving witness\n\nThe evidence left today is only part of what happened.\n\n↗")
("v15157", "item", "v15167")
("v15168", "type", "String")
("v15168", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nAsk what a failed reading teaches\n\nA failed attempt is useful when we can explain exactly what it rules out.\n\n↗")
