("v15504", "key", "text")
("v15505", "type", "String")
("v15505", "scalar", "THREADS / DAD / A SERIES FOR TEENAGERS Growing Up in the Way of Jesus GROWING UP IN THE WAY OF JESUS Faith, courage, and becoming your own person Learning to love, think, speak, listen and take responsibility, with room for questions, mistakes, joy and change. Written directly to teenagers. Room for questions, discoveries and a future of your own. ONE STEP AT A TIME A way into the series. Begin with Room to Grow. The next seven articles are taking shape. 01 / OPENING ARTICLE Room to Grow Jesus grew. You have room to grow too.")
