("v15596", "type", "Entry")
("v15596", "key", "text")
("v15597", "type", "String")
("v15597", "scalar", "THREADS / DAD Being here is part of the work. AARON ALDERMAN / DAD A person before a problem. What does it mean to be here as Dad? Begin with attention, make room for another will, and stay willing to repair the moments I get wrong. A SERIES FOR TEENAGERS Growing Up in the Way of Jesus Learning to love, think, speak, listen and take responsibility, with room for questions, mistakes, joy and change. Written directly to teenagers. Opening article · Draft for review BEGIN WITH A PERSONAL ESSAY What does it mean to be here as Dad? The work includes listening, protection, play and letting a child become someone I cannot script. A personal essay about the kind of presence I want to offer.")
("v15596", "value", "v15597")
