("v15652", "type", "String")
("v15652", "scalar", "AARON ALDERMAN / SOURCERER A perspective on shared terrain. Start where a system meets evidence, responsibility or repair. The highlighted places are invitations to investigate, not claims of scientific equivalence. AARON ALDERMAN / AN ATLAS OF IDEAS A map for making things answerable. Start where a system meets evidence, responsibility or repair. The highlighted places are invitations to investigate, not claims of scientific equivalence. Every light is a place. Hover or use Tab to discover it, then click or press Enter to explore. Swipe or scroll sideways to discover more, or use the full list below. Choose a light on the map. Tap for a preview, then choose Explore to open the place. Your journey is beginning. Seen places are remembered only in this browser.")
