("v15847", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nFollow an intention toward action\n\nChoosing to act and carrying out an action are different parts of a story.\n\n↗")
("v15838", "item", "v15847")
("v15848", "type", "String")
("v15848", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nTurn toward another person\n\nBefore answering, ask what the other person is trying to do.\n\n↗")
("v15838", "item", "v15848")
("v15849", "type", "String")
("v15849", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nLook closely at an ordinary thing\n\nA stone can tell several stories, and each needs a different kind of evidence.\n\n↗")
("v15838", "item", "v15849")
