("v15901", "scalar", "FOLLOW THE RESEARCH\nReturn to the measuring tool\n\nA measuring tool can miss a change that another tool would reveal.\n\n↗")
("v15892", "item", "v15901")
("v15902", "type", "String")
("v15902", "scalar", "FOLLOW THE RESEARCH\nLet someone check the record\n\nKeep enough of the method for someone else to check the result.\n\n↗")
("v15892", "item", "v15902")
("v15903", "type", "String")
("v15903", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nAnd when the instrument is a question?\n\nBefore answering, ask what the other person is trying to do.\n\n↗")
