("v15914", "type", "String")
("v15914", "scalar", "READING AS SOURCERER As a Sourcerer, ask what is observed, what permits the action, and what would let another person check or revise it. The underlying reading and source evidence are shared. Open the shared version ↗ UNDERSTANDING PEOPLE Remember to care. Who or what needs my attention here? The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. Aaron’s account, in wording open to revision PERSONAL ACCOUNT · WORKING DRAFT When an idea takes up all our attention, we can lose sight of the people living with its consequences. Who is carrying a cost? What have I stopped noticing? Care might mean listening, offering protection, setting a boundary, or changing an explanation. You can stay with the question without having to produce a lesson or an answer. ")
("v15913", "value", "v15914")
