("v15952", "type", "String")
("v15952", "scalar", "REFLECTIVE PASSAGE\nMeet a horse with reservations\n\nThe guide offers a lesson. The horse has noticed something else.\n\n↗")
("v15944", "item", "v15952")
("v15953", "type", "String")
("v15953", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nWhen an explanation loses contact\n\nAn answer can sound convincing while missing what someone meant.\n\n↗")
("v15944", "item", "v15953")
("v15954", "type", "String")
("v15954", "scalar", "FOLLOW RESPONSIBILITY\nWhen restraint needs to become protection\n\nBeing able to control something does not settle whether you should.\n\n↗")
("v15944", "item", "v15954")
("v15955", "type", "String")
("v15955", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nStay with the personal account\n\nA passage from Aaron’s own account.\n\n↗")
("v15944", "item", "v15955")
("v15956", "type", "String")
("v15956", "scalar", "A PATH INTO THE WIDER WORLD\nWhat comes into attention?\n\nLooking closely at one thing can make its surroundings harder to notice.\n\n↗")
