("v16134", "type", "String")
("v16134", "scalar", "READING AS SOURCERER As a Sourcerer, ask what is observed, what permits the action, and what would let another person check or revise it. The underlying reading and source evidence are shared. Open the shared version ↗ USING POWER RESPONSIBLY Someone else can change the question. An outside reply can reveal a question we failed to ask ourselves. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. A record of an exchange, with views separately attributed The correspondence record keeps an earlier assessment and the response that changed the discussion. It identifies whose view is whose. An exchange does not become agreement or independent verification. Open the cards to see what helps another person check a contribution: the exact source, what was expected, what happened and what could be tried next. Nothing is sent from this page. Open the cards to see what helps someone else check a contribution. ")
