("v16606", "scalar", "LOOK MORE CLOSELY\nWho calibrated the richer view?\n\nBefore trusting a number, check what the tool can measure.\n\n↗")
("v16597", "item", "v16606")
("v16607", "type", "String")
("v16607", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nReturn to the fork\n\nYou can come back to the same place with something facing a different way.\n\n↗")
("v16597", "item", "v16607")
("v16608", "type", "String")
("v16608", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nHow do you preserve what a model knows?\n\nLet machines help with the work while people keep a meaningful say in what is made.\n\n↗")
