("v17020", "scalar", "PERSONAL ACCOUNT · WORKING DRAFT")
("v17011", "item", "v17020")
("v17021", "type", "String")
("v17021", "scalar", "I experienced my children becoming alienated from me. It broke my heart. My marriage suffered, and my wife left.")
("v17011", "item", "v17021")
("v17022", "type", "String")
("v17022", "scalar", "I took kenosis seriously. I trusted the process. Along the way, I had to remember to care. In the intensity of everything, it could become totalizing.")
