("v17107", "type", "String")
("v17107", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nA path is another requirement\n\nA place can be allowed and still have no available route from here.\n\n↗")
("v17097", "item", "v17107")
("v17108", "type", "String")
("v17108", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nWho may choose?\n\n“Can I?”, “May I?” and “Should I?” are three different questions.\n\n↗")
("v17097", "item", "v17108")
("v17109", "type", "String")
("v17109", "scalar", "FOLLOW THE RESEARCH\nLet a pattern grow\n\nA precise counting rule can connect patterns without making them the same thing.\n\n↗")
("v17097", "item", "v17109")
