("v17160", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nReturn to the object\n\nA stone can tell several stories, and each needs a different kind of evidence.\n\n↗")
("v17151", "item", "v17160")
("v17161", "type", "String")
("v17161", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nAsk what the record cannot recover\n\nOnce a record leaves out a difference, that record may be unable to recover it.\n\n↗")
("v17151", "item", "v17161")
("v17162", "type", "String")
("v17162", "scalar", "OPTIONAL HISTORICAL CROSSING\nEnter the reading room\n\nA reading that fits a text is not yet evidence that it predicted an event.\n\n↗")
