("v17485", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nLook at the first question again\n\nTwo different things can look the same through one kind of measurement.\n\n↗")
("v17476", "item", "v17485")
("v17486", "type", "String")
("v17486", "scalar", "READ A RELATED ACCOUNT\nRead the successor inquiry\n\nAn answer can sound convincing while missing what someone meant.\n\n↗")
("v17476", "item", "v17486")
("v17487", "type", "String")
("v17487", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nStay with the discomfort\n\nFeeling hurt does not tell us, by itself, which explanation is true.\n\n↗")
