("v17873", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nReturn to the conditional result\n\nWaiting has different costs when needs are more urgent.\n\n↗")
("v17864", "item", "v17873")
("v17874", "type", "String")
("v17874", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nSeparate capability from responsibility\n\n“Can I?”, “May I?” and “Should I?” are three different questions.\n\n↗")
("v17864", "item", "v17874")
("v17875", "type", "String")
("v17875", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nAsk whether the preferred option is reachable\n\nA place can be allowed and still have no available route from here.\n\n↗")
