("v17938", "scalar", "READING AS SOURCERER As a Sourcerer, ask what is observed, what permits the action, and what would let another person check or revise it. The underlying reading and source evidence are shared. Open the shared version ↗ USING POWER RESPONSIBLY Can you follow a change? Change a title or label, then see exactly what follows. The interactive example has its own motion control. Scroll inside it if you need more room. A design philosophy with a small working example One story appears in a menu, a row and a story page. Some words come from the same source. The menu also has its own label. Open the workshop and try changing each value. Watch which views change and which keep their wording. You can open the code if you want more detail. Your edits stay in that tab and reset when you reload.  ")
("v17937", "value", "v17938")
