("v17979", "type", "String")
("v17979", "scalar", "THE PRODUCT PHILOSOPHY\nWhat should the machine leave to us?\n\nLet machines help with the work while people keep a meaningful say in what is made.\n\n↗")
("v17970", "item", "v17979")
("v17980", "type", "String")
("v17980", "scalar", "IDEAS TO COMPARE\nWhat if a polished result misses the point?\n\nAn answer can sound convincing while missing what someone meant.\n\n↗")
("v17970", "item", "v17980")
("v17981", "type", "String")
("v17981", "scalar", "ANOTHER WAY BACK\nWho is this helping?\n\nWho or what needs my attention here?\n\n↗")
("v17970", "item", "v17981")
("v17982", "type", "String")
("v17982", "scalar", "A PATH INTO THE WIDER WORLD\nLeave something another person can continue\n\nAn outside reply can reveal a question we failed to ask ourselves.\n\n↗")
("v17970", "item", "v17982")
("v17983", "type", "String")
("v17983", "scalar", "Reading paths →")
("v17970", "item", "v17983")
("v17984", "type", "String")
