("v18043", "key", "text")
("v18044", "type", "String")
("v18044", "scalar", "THREADS / SOURCERER Make the magic answerable. AARON ALDERMAN / SOURCERER Wonder, with its workings in view. How does an idea become something people can inspect, use and change? Follow observation into explanation, permission into action, and a mistake into repair. BEGIN WITH A PERSONAL ESSAY What do I owe the people who use what I build? Making something possible is the beginning. The deeper work is to keep its meaning, authority and consequences visible to the people living with it. FOLLOW A THREAD INTO LIFE Three ways to keep reading. Follow the work from evidence to explanation, from permission to action, and from a changed system to a way back. 01 / EVIDENCE & EXPLANATION")
("v18043", "value", "v18044")
