("v18091", "entry", "v18096")
("v18096", "type", "Entry")
("v18096", "key", "text")
("v18097", "type", "String")
("v18097", "scalar", "WORLDWRIGHT / IN PREPARATION A world taking shape. A storytelling product for worlds with more than one way through. Worldwright is being developed as an environment for authoring and presenting connected stories. A world holds the people, ideas, events and sources; a composition arranges encounters and passages; a journey is the route a reader actually takes. Its guiding idea is that an author can shape a meaningful experience while leaving readers room to choose, question and return. This personal expedition is the first composition. The wider authoring product remains in development. This is a placeholder for the Worldwright microsite.")
("v18096", "value", "v18097")
