("v18250", "type", "String")
("v18250", "scalar", "AARON ALDERMAN / FAITH & INTERPRETATION Faith, with open hands.")
("v18249", "item", "v18250")
("v18251", "type", "String")
("v18251", "scalar", "How I read God, Jesus, the Bible and other religions.")
("v18249", "item", "v18251")
("v18252", "type", "String")
("v18252", "scalar", "A personal theological essay · A working reading, open to correction I want a faith that can look closely: at Jesus, at a difficult passage, at another person, and at the harm done in God’s name.")
("v18249", "item", "v18252")
("v18253", "type", "String")
("v18253", "scalar", "I also want room for worship, prayer and hope.")
("v18249", "item", "v18253")
("v18254", "type", "String")
("v18254", "scalar", "Careful interpretation belongs inside that life.")
("v18249", "item", "v18254")
("v18255", "type", "String")
("v18255", "scalar", "The reading behind this corpus begins with a conviction: power should serve life, and Jesus gives that conviction its Christian centre.")
("v18249", "item", "v18255")
("v18256", "type", "String")
("v18256", "scalar", "What follows is an account of that reading.")
("v18249", "item", "v18256")
("v18257", "type", "String")
("v18257", "scalar", "I am responsible for its choices; calling them Christian does not make them the only Christian choices.")
("v18249", "item", "v18257")
("v18258", "type", "String")
("v18258", "scalar", "IN THIS ESSAY What do I mean by God?")
("v18249", "item", "v18258")
("v18259", "type", "String")
("v18259", "scalar", "Why begin with Jesus?")
("v18249", "item", "v18259")
("v18260", "type", "String")
("v18260", "scalar", "How do I read the Bible?")
("v18249", "item", "v18260")
("v18261", "type", "String")
