("v18296", "key", "text")
("v18297", "type", "String")
("v18297", "scalar", "AARON ALDERMAN / THOUGHTS Ideas worth working toward. Essays on power, understanding, faith, and what we can build together. THE FOUNDATIONAL ESSAY Power Must Serve Life We can build a civilisation in which growing power gives people greater freedom to live, understand, create, and care. I intend to help make it real. The full arc of a kenotic programme for science, computing, and human flourishing. From following Jesus and an account of power shaped by service, through disciplined inquiry and accountable construction, into capabilities people can keep. Extended mission essay · Draft for review FAITH & INTERPRETATION Faith, with open hands. How I read God, Jesus, the Bible and other religions. A personal Christian reading with room for careful interpretation, honest disagreement and correction. DAD / A PERSONAL ESSAY")
("v18296", "value", "v18297")
